  ('Further Mathematics', 'OCR A', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Further Calculus', 'How do you find the volume between two curves rotated about the x-axis?', 'V = π ∫ (y₁² − y₂²) dx, where y₁ is the outer curve.', 21),
